Codex is signed in with headers, which recite does not support. recite needs a personal ChatGPT sign-in.
  See the current sign-in:
      CODEX_HOME=/srv/codex-home '/opt/codex tools/bin/codex' login status
  Switching to a ChatGPT sign-in is your decision, so recite prints no command for it.
More help: https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/auth
